---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="impact" class="bg-wolves-black px-8 py-20 md:py-24">
	<SectionHeading title="Our Impact" subtitle="Community first" />
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[87.5rem] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
		<div
			class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl border border-wolves-gold/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-wolves-gold/10 to-wolves-orange/5 p-10"
		>
			<p class="font-oswald mb-4 text-5xl font-bold text-wolves-gold md:text-6xl">300</p>
			<p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/90">
				Registered members across junior and senior programmes — a single club home for families
				from every part of Cape Town.
			</p>
			<p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-wolves-gold/90">Scale that sponsors can see</p>
		</div>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-8 lg:col-span-7">
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-wolves-dark-gray/80 p-8">
				<h3 class="font-oswald mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-wolves-gold">
					90% from underserved communities
				</h3>
				<p class="leading-relaxed text-white/85">
					Nine in ten members come from previously disadvantaged and gang-affected neighbourhoods
					including Hanover Park, Steenberg, Langa, and Lotus River. Football is the hook; structure,
					mentorship, and belonging are the outcome.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-wolves-dark-gray/80 p-8">
				<h3 class="font-oswald mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-wolves-gold">
					15 young people at Lillieblom House
				</h3>
				<p class="leading-relaxed text-white/85">
					We subsidise full participation for fifteen boys and girls from Lillieblom House — a home
					for children who have experienced abuse and neglect — so cost is never a barrier to
					training or match day.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-wolves-dark-gray/80 p-8">
				<h3 class="font-oswald mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-wolves-gold">
					Mathematics, literacy & life skills
				</h3>
				<p class="leading-relaxed text-white/85">
					Beyond the touchline we are building mathematics and literacy tutoring, with a roadmap to
					life-skills modules on peer pressure, conflict resolution, and substance abuse — so players
					practice good decisions with the same rigour as first touch.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-[87.5rem] text-center text-sm text-white/60">
		Highlights align with our 2026 sponsorship prospectus; audited milestones delivered under prior
		Allan Gray Philanthropy Foundation support.
	</p>
</section>
